# The Island-only twin of the one-big-creature scenario: Bot1 controls Temur Battlecrier (power 4) and Bot2 controls Giant
# Cindermaw (power 4). Frantic Search costs {1}{U} for Bot1, so with one Island untapped it cannot be cast: the Cindermaw is not
# "a creature you control" (CR 601.2f, 118.7a). The positive control is the one-big-creature scenario, where the second mana
# source makes the same cast possible.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Temur Battlecrier
Frantic Search
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Giant Cindermaw
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Giant Cindermaw.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Temur Battlecrier.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Frantic Search.Cast(Mana: short)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Giant Cindermaw.Power = 4
